Short:        Application builder with database capabilities
Author:       CLIVE@COLSTOTT.DEMON.CO.UK
Uploader:     COL COLSTOTT DEMON CO UK
Type:         biz/misc
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Requirements: 1 Mb Amiga
Distrubution: Distribute freely

This program will search a database very quickly, it will also
calculate moving averages for shares and it can handle graphics
such as maps with the capability of zooming in and out.
